Target side of forkserver_storfuzz/storfuzz.patch, verbatim: every hunk except
fuzzers/forkserver_libafl_cc/src/main.rs, the forkserver_storfuzz fuzzer this
arm does not use. What is left builds the unibench targets:

  - src/bin/libafl_cc.rs  the compiler wrapper, with the StorFuzzCoverage and
                          AutoTokens passes FuzzBench's wrapper has
  - src/lib.rs            the runtime linked into each target: forkserver
                          started from .init_array, StorFuzz data map attached
  - libafl_targets/src/forkserver.{c,rs}
                          map the data map from __STORFUZZ_SHM_ID shared memory
  - Cargo.toml            features and dependencies of that runtime

